<PluginData xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:type="GitHubPlugin">

    <!-- The ID of your plugin, never change this -->
    <Id>22C5F3D1-AE85-4FB1-96FB-E53E9ABBF035</Id>

    <!-- GitHub repository ID -->
    <RepoId>viktor-ferenczi/se-better-store</RepoId>

    <!-- The name of your plugin that will appear in the plugin list -->
    <FriendlyName>Better Store</FriendlyName>

    <!-- The author name that you want to appear in the plugin list -->
    <Author>Viktor</Author>

    <!-- Optional tooltip for the plugin in the plugin list -->
    <Tooltip>A Store screen that trades with your whole ship: buy what fits, sell all, round amounts</Tooltip>

    <!-- Optional plugin description. If omitted, this will be the same as the Tooltip. 1000 characters max. -->
    <Description>Replaces the screen of the Store block with one that is quicker to trade on.

        - Pick your docked ship instead of a cargo container. The plugin puts what you buy into the containers with room for it, and takes what you sell from the containers that hold it.
        - Round amounts with one click: 100 kg, 1 t, 10 t, 100 t, half, or all that fits. Type "2.5t" if you want something else.
        - Buy what fits: the most your cargo space, your money and the Store's stock allow.
        - Sell all of an item, or all the cargo the Store wants, with one button.
        - Gas offers fill your ship's tanks.
        - Works with Stores that sell bulk goods in 1,000 kg lots next to single units, like Octahedron's.

        Store owners still manage their Store on the game's own screen, behind the Administration button.

        Report bugs on GitHub: https://github.com/viktor-ferenczi/se-better-store/issues
    </Description>

    <!-- Only source code in the Directory entries listed in SourceDirectories is compiled. Exclude any test projects or similar. -->
